sentences.text:
Hence, the Applications are allowed on the following terms and conditions :-
(a) In the event of arrest of the Applicants in C.R.No.291/2023 registered with Mangalwedha Police Station, Solapur, they shall be released on bail on furnishing P.H. Jayani 14 AND 15.doc bail bonds in the sum of Rs.25,000/- each with one or two sureties in the like amount ;
(b) The Applicants shall report to the Investigating Officer for two days i.e., on 07/06/2023 and 08/06/2023 between 11:00 a.m. to 02:00 p.m. ;

